<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy — MathQuest: Number Puzzle" description="Privacy Policy for MathQuest: Number Puzzle by Pradeept Bhanu.">
  <section style="padding:6rem 0 2rem"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">MathQuest: Number Puzzle</div><h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="section-copy">Last updated: September 13, 2026</p></div></section>
  <section style="padding-top:1rem"><div class="container"><div class="panel" style="padding:2rem;line-height:1.8">
    <h2>1. About this policy</h2><p>MathQuest: Number Puzzle is a math crossword and number puzzle game developed and published by Pradeept Bhanu. This policy explains how information is handled when you use the App.</p>
    <h2>2. Information handled by the App</h2><p>The App stores game progress, puzzle state and preferences locally on your device. If you choose to use Google Play Games, the App may receive limited profile information made available by Google Play Games, such as your player display name, and may use Play Games features such as authentication and leaderboards. The App does not request or store your Google account password.</p>
    <h2>3. Google Play Games</h2><p>Google Play Games Services may be used for player authentication, profile display and leaderboard features. Information processed by Google Play Games is handled according to Google's own privacy practices and account settings. You can continue playing the game without signing in to Google Play Games, although online Play Games features may not be available in guest mode.</p>
    <h2>4. Local game data</h2><p>Game progress and preferences may be stored locally on your device, including your current puzzle, unlocked levels, entered answers, mistakes, elapsed time, hints, lives and whether you have chosen guest mode. This local information is used to restore your game experience and preferences.</p>
    <h2>5. Advertising and analytics</h2><p>MathQuest: Number Puzzle does not currently use third-party advertising or analytics SDKs. If advertising, analytics or other third-party services are added in a future version, this privacy policy will be updated to describe the related data practices.</p>
    <h2>6. How information is used</h2><ul><li>Provide and maintain the game.</li><li>Save game progress and preferences on your device.</li><li>Authenticate players through Google Play Games when you choose to sign in.</li><li>Provide leaderboard and related Play Games features when enabled.</li><li>Maintain guest-mode preferences.</li><li>Diagnose technical problems and improve game stability.</li></ul>
    <h2>7. Sharing and third-party services</h2><p>We do not sell your personal information. Limited information may be processed by Google Play Games Services when you choose to use its features. Third-party processing is governed by the applicable provider's policies and your account settings.</p>
    <h2>8. Security and retention</h2><p>We take reasonable measures to protect information handled by the App. Local game data remains on your device until it is removed by clearing the App's storage or uninstalling the App. Information handled by Google Play Games is retained according to Google's applicable policies and your Google account settings.</p>
    <h2>9. Children's privacy</h2><p>MathQuest: Number Puzzle is a general-audience puzzle game and is not specifically designed to request personal information from children. The App does not intentionally ask users to provide personal details directly to the developer through the game.</p>
    <h2>10. Your choices</h2><p>You may use the App in guest mode without signing in to Google Play Games. You can also manage Google Play Games and Google account privacy settings through the settings and controls provided by Google. Local game data can be removed by clearing the App's storage or uninstalling the App.</p>
    <h2>11. Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy when the App, services, legal requirements or data practices change. The Last updated date will be changed when the policy is revised.</p>
    <h2>12. Contact</h2><p><strong>Developer:</strong> Pradeept Bhanu</p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://pradeeptbhanu.com/">pradeeptbhanu.com</a></p>
  </div></div></section>
</MainLayout>
